# Default owner. Last matching pattern wins:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
*       @jack-arturo

# Keep a human in the loop for CI and supply-chain changes,
# including Dependabot bumps of GitHub Actions.
/.github/ @jack-arturo

# No owner: a later line with no owner clears ownership, at any depth.
# Dependabot PRs that only touch these files need no code-owner review,
# so auto-merge can land them once required status checks pass.
package.json
package-lock.json
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
